<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Jon</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Jon</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Jon</para>
  <para style="mt2">2 NWER NYI</para>
  <para style="mt1">JON</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Me nnenkul,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 5:1</char></note> me wo kpꞌnyono nwer nyia tv nnenkal no Esowo m-e yehke, a abon abon ebe, bo ji kp-m koro, tib eji e kpꞌtoono etingitingi. Me ntahngtahng sang a kp-m koro, a kpꞌtob kor ane kpee ba kpꞌkahne etingitingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">3 Jon 1</char></note> <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />Tibre etingitingi ji wob go egahre ntim bahke jolo a nahre ano ano go njinanjini.<verse eid="2JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Nnoobo, ndon, a elkoono ni lohng goji Esowo Nsoo, a Jisos Kraist Mmon a Nsoo bahke jolo a nahre, a etingitingi, go elkoro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:6</char></note><verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etingitingi, a elkoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Atahng jo yeb-m sehng, eji n nyehne re, abon ebahne bandiki kpꞌtoono etingitingi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:24; 17:17</char></note> jang jang ana Nso ejahre tong-r no.<verse eid="2JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Nnenkal, n kp-a gboongo re, wahr bel elkoro atemtem. A ntahm nyi nfenfe sang n kpꞌnyono tv-a. Ntahm nyi e bele go mbomannahb nyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 2:7</char></note> <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Elkoro lohngo re, wahr jo bum atahm enye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 5:3</char></note> Ntahm nyi ana, nyi ń wuku go mbomannahb re wahn jo jen go elkoro.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Tibre anehm ane gbalee eblohng yel go njini, ane ba kil eltaame re Jisos Kraist ba go ngubjing. Elkohn nne noo nnehmane wo, ye Nnekv a Kraist wo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 4:1-3</char></note><verse eid="2JN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Gberen elnahne, eji ń lꞌkꞌtane ejum ji e limi eltum kehm bele, eji ń lꞌbel eltuuru enahne kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:11; 5:4</char></note> <verse eid="2JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Nne awohng awohng no tohko sa ano ano, jo toono eltibi ni Kraist, á lꞌta nnyab, Esowo limm a ne. Nne no lꞌsa ano, jo toono eltibi nꞌnehm, Nsoo, a Mmon, bo li a ne, bo ane abal abal.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 2:23</char></note><verse eid="2JN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌba go egahne, á tohko ko eltibi nio ba a ni, kana ye ko, kak go egahne ntahk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 1:3; Tait 1:11; Ell 2:20</char></note> Kana ye nnyo kak! <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />Tibre nne no lꞌkak-e nnyo, á li ana nne no kpo lim ebꞌbi eltum nio a ne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 5:22; Ell 18:4</char></note><verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esꞌkohro alum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />N kpi nsol gbalee nyi kehn n jol-n tongo. Me nehme kor re me n ko alahb nwer, nyon go ekpake nwer.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">3 Jon 13</char></note> N kpꞌbumu re, m bahke bake ba nyehn-n, fere bung a nahne antahng antahng, eji eyebatahng ejahre lꞌbiingi go nseenga nseenge.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Abon ba mmonanne no nkal no Esowo m-e yehke, kp-n kake nnyo.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>